                                        // ships only `pos: WorldPosition`),
                                        // so we can't gate on force /
                                        // teleport seqs here. Conservative
                                        // choice: trust the integrator's
                                        // prediction unconditionally for
                                        // `position_type == Location`
                                        // (the routine local-player
